From: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] RISC OS: native desktop frontend

A Wimp task (no SDL): icon bar, game window, full screen window,
menus, drag and drop of disc images, frames plotted from a 32bpp
sprite the core draws into, sound through SharedSoundBuffer and
StreamManager (paced by the sound), keyboard by OS_Byte 121 scans,
USB game pads through USBJoystick's API, save states, Choices.
